    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that El Ni\u00f1o drives interannual variability in the oxygen isotope ratio of atmospheric CO\u2082, using the signal's rapid decay to argue that global gross primary production is substantially higher (150-175 PgC/yr) than previously estimated.",
